{"id":"e05abb05-d25d-4af9-93e0-252b86a7b00c","title":"Glowsticks 4","slug":"glowsticks-4","collectionSlug":"glowsticks","collectionName":"Glowsticks","category":"background","categoryZh":"背景动画","description":"A dynamic gradient shader effect featuring flowing, wave-like strands that move diagonally across the composition from lower-left to upper-right. The effect creates a sense of motion and fluidity with soft, blurred edges. The color gradient transitions smoothly from cyan (#00e5ff) on the left through blue (#5b8cff) in the lower-middle section, transitioning to purple (#b06bff) in the center, and culminating in magenta-pink (#ff5fa2) on the right side. The background is a very dark navy-black (#0e071a), providing high contrast that makes the luminous strands pop. The strands have a soft, feathered quality with approximately 7 lines creating a ribbon-like appearance with significant spread and amplitude, giving the effect an organic, flowing quality. A subtle engraving texture with fine line patterns is overlaid at low opacity (0.08) using overlay blend mode, adding microscopic detail and tactile quality. The watercolor effect with minimal paper texture (0.05) softens the overall appearance, creating a dreamy, ethereal atmosphere. The entire composition has a glowing, neon-like quality with smooth color transitions and soft diffusion, suggesting movement and energy against the dark void.","colors":["#00e5ff","#5b8cff","#b06bff","#ff5fa2"],"labels":["gradient","glowing","organic","dark"],"cover":"/shaders/covers/e05abb05-d25d-4af9-93e0-252b86a7b00c.jpg","toneMapping":"aces","components":[{"type":"SolidColor","id":"idmrkroqli6v28u5p5w","_key":"key_mrkroqli6v28u5p5w","props":{"color":"#0e071a","opacity":1,"maskType":"alpha","blendMode":"normal","transform":{"edges":"transparent","scale":1,"anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"offsetX":0,"offsetY":0,"rotation":0}}},{"type":"Strands","id":"idmrkrov391qbljtz3p","_key":"key_mrkrov391qbljtz3p","props":{"end":{"x":1.02859689563857